  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Context",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "The product is an internal enterprise system used for executing structured workflows.\n\nThe interface evolved without a governing logic:"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
            "items": [
              "patterns were duplicated instead of reused",
              "similar actions behaved differently across flows",
              "system feedback was inconsistent"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "A UI kit existed, but without system integrity:"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
            "items": [
              "no shared component logic",
              "no standardized states",
              "no consistent interaction rules"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "At the same time, the system was constrained by:"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
            "items": [
              "backend-driven architecture",
              "limited ability to restructure flows",
              "high cost of breaking existing behavior"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "The product functioned, but its UX layer became increasingly inefficient to use and extend."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Problem",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "The interface lacked interaction consistency, directly impacting operational performance."
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
            "items": [
              "identical tasks behaved differently across contexts",
              "users reinterpreted UI instead of executing known actions",
              "inconsistent states increased error probability",
              "lack of predictability slowed down repetitive workflows"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "This was not a usability issue.\n\nIt was a failure of interaction standardization in a system built on repeatable execution."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Constraints",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
            "items": [
              "Core logic locked by legacy backend",
              "No mature design system to extend",
              "Changes had to be incremental and non-breaking",
              "Mixed UI quality across flows",
              "Continuous operation required"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "The solution had to be:"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "list",
          "value": {
