    {
      "title": "Design Decisions",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "1. Standardizing Interaction Patterns\n\nDecision\nUnified behavior for core actions\n\nBehavioral Change\nUsers rely on learned patterns\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* faster execution\n* reduced cognitive switching\n\nUI Proof\nSame interaction logic across flows"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "media",
          "value": {
            "src": "/cases/railway-booking-flow/1776511834161.png",
            "alt": "template"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "2. Component-Based UI Layer\n\nDecision\nReplaced fragmented UI with reusable components\n\nBehavioral Change\nPredictable interaction\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* reduced error rate\n* improved scalability\n\nUI Proof\nShared components across screens"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "media",
          "value": {
            "src": "/cases/railway-booking-flow/1776511843030.png",
            "alt": "template"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "3. Explicit State System\n\nDecision\nDefined consistent states\n\nBehavioral Change\nClear feedback at each step\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* faster recovery\n* fewer support issues\n\nUI Proof\nUnified validation and system states"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "media",
          "value": {
            "src": "/cases/railway-booking-flow/1776511851196.png",
            "alt": "template"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "4. Action Hierarchy\n\nDecision\nStandardized primary / secondary actions\n\nBehavioral Change\nClear next-step logic\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* reduced navigation errors\n* faster completion"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "5. Behavior-First Components\n\nDecision\nSeparated behavior from layout\n\nBehavioral Change\nConsistency across UI variations\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* stable UX under constraints\n* faster development"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "6. Incremental Rollout\n\nDecision\nGradual system adoption\n\nBehavioral Change\nNo disruption\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* lower risk\n* continuous improvement"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "paragraph",
          "value": {
            "text": "7. Progression Logic in Components\n\nDecision\nEncoded step logic into UI\n\nBehavioral Change\nUsers understand when to proceed\n\nOperational Impact\n\n* fewer invalid actions\n* reduced backtracking"
          }
        },
        {
          "discriminant": "media",
          "value": {
